OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested travelling to France
OL,4,Aafter fatal fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 34-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder following a fatal
OL,8,Ffire in west London.
OL,10,FThe Met was called to a residential
OL,11,Faddress on Berkeley Avenue, Hounslow,
OL,12,Fat about 01:15 BST on Wednesday
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of the blaze. A
OL,14,F48-year-old woman died in hospital and
OL,15,Feight others were injured.
OL,17,FAnother woman, aged 40, remains in
OL,18,Fhospital in a life-threatening
OL,19,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
