OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested travelling to France
OL,4,Aafter fatal fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers from Kent Police arrested the
OL,7,Fman on Sunday while he was travelling
OL,8,Fto France by train. He remains in
OL,9,Fcustody, the Metropolitan Police said.
